{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42341","headline":"奉和右省仆射西亭高卧作 · 徐铉","name":"奉和右省仆射西亭高卧作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"院静苍苔积，庭幽怪石欹。\n蝉声当槛急，虹影向檐垂。\n昼漏犹怜永，丛兰未觉衰。\n疎篁巢翡翠，折苇覆鸬鷀。\n对酒襟怀旷，围棊旨趣迟。\n景皆随所尚，物各遂其宜。\n道与时相会，才非世所羇。\n赋诗贻座客，秋事尔何悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}